      "value": "ドリームビジョン"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/dreams/1",
      "value": "^orange;Monstrous Visages^reset;\n\nYour dreams just get weirder and weirder as time goes on. You keep seeing this many-tentacled face in your dreams, so much so that you feel you can recreate its horrible form in reality...through using adorable plush toys suitable for all! Share the insanity with kids and adults alike! They'll thank you for it...eventually."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/dreams/1",
      "value": "^orange;Monstrous Visages^reset;\n\nあなたの夢は、時間が進むにつれて、より奇妙で奇妙になります。 夢の中で、この魅力的な顔を見続けると、現実にその恐ろしい形を再現できると感じます...すべての人に適した可愛らしい豪華なおもちゃを使って! 子供にも大人にも狂気を分かち合いましょう! 彼らはそれに感謝します...最終的には。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden1/0",
      "value": "The Void"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden1/0",
      "value": "ボイド"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've discovered how to see past our own dimension, and the limits of our own minds and bodies, and find a way to transcend into greater realms of existence. Unfortunately, the cost is rather high for this sort of research, but whats a few extra test subjects?"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n自分自身の次元や、私たちの心や身体の限界を過ぎて、より広い存在領域に超越する方法を見つける方法を見出しました。 残念なことに、この種の研究のコストはかなり高いですが、いくつかの追加のテスト対象は何ですか?"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden2/0",
      "value": "Forbidden Knowledge"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden2/0",
      "value": "禁じられた知識"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou're ready to move into new areas of research few even dare to attempt. Mostly because of law, ethics and morality...but those in the pursuit of science cannot waver in the face of adversity."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/forbidden2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n新しい研究分野に参入する準備が整いました。 主に法律、倫理、道徳のためですが、科学を追求している人は、逆境に直面しても揺れることができません。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes1/0",
      "value": "Cryptobiology"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes1/0",
      "value": "暗号生物学"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've seen strange things, and know that there are beings out there we cannot comprehend with our limited perception of reality. You seek to learn of how living things work, no matter how exotic. What you do with that knowledge then, well...that's another matter entirely.\n\nFlesh is your canvas, and many would disagree with your methods. So long as nobody knows...nobody will mind. Right?"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\n変なものを見たことがあり、現実に対する認識が限られていることには理解できないことが分かっています。 あなたは、どんなにエキゾチックなものでも、生物がどのように機能するかを学びたいのです。 その知識で何をするかは、それでは...それは全く別の問題です。\n\n肉塊はあなたのキャンバスであり、多くの人があなたの方法に同意しません。 誰も知らない限り、誰も気にしない。 でしょ?"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes2/0",
      "value": "Genetic Aberration"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes2/0",
      "value": "遺伝的異常"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThrough examination of corpses, you've learned a great deal about how life and death work. But you aren't interested in just the DNA sequences...no, you seek something grander. A symphony you can play on flesh and show the universe how truly beautiful life is, whether they agree with you or not."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\n死体を調べることで、生死の仕組みについて多くのことを学びました。 でも、DNA配列だけに興味はない...いや、もっと壮大なものを求めます。 肉体で演奏し、それらがあなたに同意するかどうかに関係なく、本当に美しい人生がいかに宇宙を示すことができる交響曲。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes3/0",
      "value": "Reanimation"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes3/0",
      "value": "再アニメーション"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes3/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nLife and Death are only suggestions to you. You have learned to work within both the realm of the living and that of the dead. By fusing the two, you will accomplish the long-sought secret of eternal life, and so much more. \n\nYour perception of reality isn't what it used to be, though, and you've a tenuous grasp on things...at best."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\n生と死はあなたにしか提案できません。 あなたは生きている領域と死んだ領域の両方で働くことを学びました。 両者を融合させることで、永遠の生命の永遠の秘密などを実現できます。 \n\nでも、現実に対する認識は、昔とは違って、物事をきつく理解している...せいぜい。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes4/0",
      "value": "Genesis"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes4/0",
      "value": "創世記"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes4/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou are a god among sentient beings. You, the one who has mastery over life and death can now simply create life at a whim. You will seed the universe with your creations and change the very face of the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/genes4/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 6^reset;\n\nあなたは感覚的な存在の神です。 生死を熟知している君は、ただ気まぐれで人生を創り出すことができる。 あなたはあなたの創造物で宇宙を種まきし、宇宙の顔を変えます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis/0",
      "value": "Chemical Experiments"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis/0",
      "value": "化学実験"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nWho needs knowledge and chemistry education when you can just jam things into beakers until something neat happens? That's your process, and so far it works well. You see no reason to change."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 1^reset;\n\n何か良いことが起こるまでビーカーにジャムできるのに、知識と化学教育が必要なのは誰ですか? それがあなたのプロセスです。今のところはうまく機能しています。 変わる理由はありません。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis2/0",
      "value": "Applied Narcotics"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis2/0",
      "value": "応用麻薬"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou bad little scientist, you! You've gone and devised illegal substances that can alter perception of reality itself...provided you don't die of course! Also, you've got poutine. What could go wrong?"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\n悪い科学者だよ、君! あなたは、現実そのものの認識を変えることができる違法な物質を考案した...あなたがもちろん死ななければ! また、プーチンがあります。 何がうまくいかないのでしょうか?"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis3/0",
      "value": "Weird Concoctions"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis3/0",
      "value": "奇妙な調味料"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis3/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWell, you've gone and learned stuff about chemicals after all. Turns out it was actually pretty useful, because now you can make narcotics and stimulants that don't even make sense in this reality! You'll be the talk of the town. Or simply insane. Either way, awesome."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/myphis3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\n化学品について学んだことはありますよね 今では、この現実で意味をなさない麻薬や覚せい剤を作ることができるので、実際にはかなり有用でした! 君はその町のおしゃべりになるだろう。 または単に狂気。 どちらにしても、すごい。"
    }
