      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nNow that you have a basic grasp of Psionic powers, you can begin to experiment in new ways to focus that power. You're able to fabricate various types of attacks for your Psionic Focus."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionicpower3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\n超能力 Powersの基本的な理解ができたので、そのパワーに焦点を当てる新しい方法で実験を開始することができます。 超能力 Focus のさまざまなタイプの攻撃を作成できます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics1/0",
      "value": "Psionics"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
