      "value": "生理学"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned that the brain is a marvellous thing, and unlocking its secrets is only the beginning. To really dig in you'll need to...dig in. Are there ethical issues with removing brains from subjects? Yes. Do you care? Probably not...\n\nYou can now harvest brains from subjects for further study with the use of a Brain Extractor."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\n脳は素晴らしいものだということを学び、その秘密を解き放つことが始まりに過ぎません。 本当に掘り出すには、...掘り出す必要があります。 被験者から脳を取り除くことに倫理的な問題はありますか? はい。 気にする? おそらく...\n\n被験者から脳を収穫して脳抽出器を使ってさらに研究することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics2/0",
      "value": "Mental Energy"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics2/0",
      "value": "精神エネルギー"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe energy that binds all things, the very life-essence of the cosmos, is at long last a thing you can quantify. While the results are less than concrete, you cannot deny the truths you have discovered in your studies.\n\nYou can now use brains and their 'Psionic Energy' to accomplish incredible things."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\n宇宙の生命の本質であるすべてのものを結び付けるエネルギーは、ついに定量化できるものとなった。 結果は具体的ではありませんが、研究で発見した真実を否定することはできません。\n\n脳と「陽子エネルギー」を使って、信じられないほどのことを実現できます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics3/0",
      "value": "Astral Projection"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics3/0",
      "value": "アストラル・プロジェクション"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics3/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nNot only have you proven psionics are real, you've learned to harness the brain itself to grant untold possibilities to science! Your next task is to learn to use your own mind to do impossible things. You can start by connecting with your Astral self...who knows what awaits beyond that."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\nあなたに証明された精神病は本物であるだけでなく、脳そのものを利用して科学に未知の可能性を与えることを学びました! あなたの次の仕事は、不可能なことをするために自分自身の心を使うことを学ぶことです。 まずは、Astralの自己とつながることから始めましょう。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics4/0",
      "value": "Psionic Channeling"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics4/0",
      "value": "ピオニクスチャネル"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics4/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou can harness the raw essence of mental energy and utilize it to accomplish impossible feats, power technology, and so much more. None can doubt your mastery of the mind. If only you could stop the voices from whispering to you when nobody is looking..."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psionics4/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 6^reset;\n\n精神エネルギーの生のエッセンスを活かし、不可能な偉業やパワー技術などを実現することができます。 誰も君の頭脳を疑うことはできない。 誰も見ていないのに、声を止めてささやくことができれば......。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry/0",
      "value": "Psychiatric Help"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry/0",
      "value": "精神医学的援助"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThanks to modern psychiatric help you can seek out a bit of aid should you feel disconnected from reality. Sure, they'll psychoanalyze you. Sure, it's expensive. Sure, they think you're nuts...but all of that is still better than eating your own face or ruining yourself with crippling addictions. It definitely won't be as fun, however."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 1^reset;\n\n現代の精神医学的助けのおかげで、現実から切り離されたと感じたら、少し助けを求めることができます。 もちろん、彼らはあなたを分析します。 確かに、それは高価です。 確かに、彼らはあなたが無能だと考えています...しかし、そのすべてはまだあなた自身の顔を食べるよりも良いか、または破滅的な依存症で自分自身を台無しにします。 でも、それは決して楽しいことではありません。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry2/0",
      "value": "Psychiatric Help II"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry2/0",
      "value": "精神医学的援助II"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou can hire more reliable help, thanks to your rapidly escalating mental issues. It's much easier to get approved on your health plan now!"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\n急速に拡大する精神的な問題のおかげで、より信頼性の高い助けを雇うことができます。 今すぐあなたの健康計画で承認を得るのははるかに簡単です!"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/psychiatry3/0",
      "value": "Psychiatric Help III"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
