      "value": "夢のささやき"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/starteroption/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 0^reset;\n\nLately, you've been thinking of things in new ways. The numerous sciences feel new to you again, and you are anxious to utilize fresh methodologies in your experimentation and theorizing.\n\nThis all came about thanks to your dreams, where you swear you've heard voices whispering new theories and formulas to you. Obviously it's just your genius manifesting while you sleep, but it ^green;feels like more^reset; to you. You are compelled to investigate these thoughts."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/starteroption/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 0^reset;\n\n最近、物事を新しいやり方で考えています。 たくさんの科学があなたに再び新しいと感じ、あなたはあなたの実験と理論化に新鮮な方法論を利用することを切望しています。\n\nこれはすべてあなたの夢のおかげで生まれました。新しい理論や公式をあなたにささやく声が聞こえました。 眠っている間、あなたの天才が現れるのは明らかですが、それは^green;があなたにとってより^reset;のように感じます。 あなたはこれらの考えを調査せざるを得ない。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon1/0",
      "value": "Emergent Technology"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon1/0",
      "value": "新たな技術"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou're trying to delve into ways to improve existing technology as well as new sorts of machines and ideas beyond those of your peers. No topic is too strange! \n\nYou've been dreaming of a mathmatical formula that has been driving you slowly mad...and the only solution is to unscramble the numbers until the formulas speak to you. Whatever comes of it will surely be amazing!"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\n既存の技術を改良する方法だけでなく、同業者の発想を超える新たな機械や概念も探究している。どんなに奇妙な題材でも構わない！ \n\n夢に現れる数式が、あなたを少しずつ狂わせている……解決するには、数字を組み直し、数式が語りかけてくるまで考え続けるしかない。何が生まれようと、きっと素晴らしいはずだ！"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon2/0",
      "value": "Particle Entropy"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon2/0",
      "value": "粒子エントロピー"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nConventional physics says that all energy simply becomes something else, and that nothing is truly ever destroyed. You're out to prove this wrong, because you know better! You can reach right into subspace and manipulate the fabric of reality to create a new sort of matter, and can construct potent robotic minions."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\n従来の物理学は、すべてのエネルギーは単に何か別のものになり、何も本当に破壊されないと言います。 よくわかっているから、この間違いを証明しよう! サブスペースに手を伸ばし、現実の枠組みを操作して、新しい種類の物質を作成し、強力なロボットミニオンを構築することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon3/0",
      "value": "Biomorphic Particles"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon3/0",
      "value": "生体形態粒子"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon3/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nBeing this smart sure is great! Nobody understands particles quite like you do, and you've got a way to prove it: By combining particles with biomass to form entirely new constructs that violate the ordinary laws of existence!"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\nこれほど頭がいいのは、実に素晴らしい！ 粒子をあなたほど理解している者はいない。その証明方法も見つけた。粒子をバイオマスと組み合わせ、通常の存在法則に逆らう、まったく新たな構造物を生み出すのだ！"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/weapon4/0",
      "value": "Reality Bridge"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
